### Colección de ejemplo (REST Client de VS Code / JetBrains HTTP Client).
### Flujo completo de la guía §5. Las firmas (SEP-53 y XDR) se hacen en el CLIENTE; ver docs/signing-flow.md.
@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = REEMPLAZAR_TRAS_LOGIN
@orderId = REEMPLAZAR
@checkoutToken = REEMPLAZAR

### 1. Login por email OTP (SIMULADO: devCode vuelve en la respuesta fuera de producción)
POST {{base}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "importadora@example.local" }

###
POST {{base}}/auth/session
Content-Type: application/json

{ "provider": "mock-email-otp", "email": "importadora@example.local", "code": "123456" }

### 1b. Login con wallet Stellar (SEP-53, criptografía real)
POST {{base}}/auth/wallet/challenge
Content-Type: application/json

{ "address": "GACPZZRWGFNNZDQDJ2LWYJITSQJFDZFRDIVO2SWWPLS4MZ6LXZ22FAA6" }

### firma el campo "message" con: stellar message sign "<message>" --sign-with-key ie-buyer
POST {{base}}/auth/session
Content-Type: application/json

{ "provider": "stellar-wallet", "challengeId": "UUID", "signature": "BASE64" }

### 2. Vincular wallet (prueba de posesión SEP-53)
POST {{base}}/me/wallets/challenge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "address": "GCHEQIGMYICXZ6GBPZYWRNNYQQBYZ565DDOKSXXUJFVEYIBDOQMV74SQ" }

###
POST {{base}}/me/wallets/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "challengeId": "UUID", "signature": "BASE64", "provider": "self-custody" }

### 3. Registrar importadora (queda PENDING)
POST {{base}}/importers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "publicName": "Importadora Ejemplo", "nit": "1234567" }

### 4. (ADMIN) verificar y fijar límites — anticipo deshabilitado por defecto
POST {{base}}/admin/importers/IMPORTER_ID/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{base}}/admin/importers/IMPORTER_ID/limits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "maxOrderAmountAtomic": "50000000000", "maxAdvanceBps": 8000, "allowedModes": ["FULL_ESCROW", "PARTIAL_ADVANCE"] }

### 5. Wallet de cobro de la importadora
POST {{base}}/importers/me/wallet/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletId": "WALLET_UUID" }

### 6. Cotización PARTIAL: 1.200 total, 900 de anticipo (unidades atómicas, 7 decimales)
POST {{base}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: quote-0001-ejemplo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0EXAMPLE",
  "productName": "MacBook Air 13",
  "productVariant": "M4 16GB",
  "quantity": 1,
  "destinationCity": "La Paz",
  "deliveryEstimateDays": 20,
  "purchaseTerms": "Compra en Amazon US; courier a La Paz.",
  "fiatPrice": "8352.00",
  "fiatCurrency": "BOB",
  "amountAtomic": "12000000000",
  "serviceFeeAtomic": "200000000",
  "fx": { "rate": "6.96", "spreadBps": 50, "source": "manual", "expiresAt": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z" },
  "escrowMode": "PARTIAL_ADVANCE",
  "advanceAmountAtomic": "9000000000",
  "expiresAt": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "fulfillmentDeadline": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 7. Publicar: congela términos y devuelve el token del checkout (una sola vez)
POST {{base}}/quotes/QUOTE_ID/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: publish-0001-ejemplo

### 8. Vista pública sanitizada
GET {{base}}/checkout/{{checkoutToken}}

### 9. Comprador acepta (termsHash y disclosure* vienen de la vista)
POST {{base}}/checkout/{{checkoutToken}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: accept-0001-ejemplo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "termsHash": "HEX64", "buyerWallet": "G...", "acceptTerms": true, "disclosureVersion": "partial/v1", "disclosureHash": "HEX64" }

### 10. (opcional, SIMULADO) rampa BOB -> token a la wallet
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/ramp/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Preparar funding (devuelve XDR sin firmar + txHash)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/escrow/prepare-funding
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: fund-0001-ejemplo

### 12. Enviar la tx FIRMADA por la wallet del comprador
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/escrow/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: submit-0001-ejemplo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "preparedId": "UUID", "signedXdr": "BASE64_XDR_FIRMADO" }

### 13. Estado on-chain + proyección + txs con enlace al explorador
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/escrow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. (importadora) anticipo antes de comprar — solo PARTIAL
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/advance/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: adv-0001-ejemplo

### 15. Logística (solo avanza; ACCEPTED solo por confirmación on-chain)
PATCH {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/logistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "state": "IN_TRANSIT", "trackingNumber": "TRK-12345", "carrier": "DHL" }

### 16. Evidencia: URL de subida prefirmada (luego PUT del archivo y confirm-upload)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/evidence/upload-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "RECEIPT", "mimeType": "application/pdf", "sizeBytes": 12345, "sha256": "HEX64" }

### 17. Comprador confirma entrega (libera SOLO el saldo retenido)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/delivery/prepare-confirmation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: deliv-0001-ejemplo

### 18. Disputa (razón privada off-chain; on-chain solo su hash)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/disputes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: disp-0001-ejemplo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "El producto no llegó en el plazo pactado." }

### 19. (árbitro) resolución: debe sumar EXACTAMENTE el saldo retenido
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/disputes/DISPUTE_ID/prepare-resolution
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: resol-0001-ejemplo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refundToBuyerAtomic": "3000000000", "releaseToImporterAtomic": "0", "resolution": "Devolución del saldo retenido." }

### Operación
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###
GET http://localhost:3000/ready
